"IsiX DICOM Viewer is configured to use the database located at %@. This volume is currently not available, most likely because it hasn't yet been mounted by the system, or because it is not plugged in or is turned off, or because you don't have write permissions for this location. IsiX DICOM Viewer will wait for a few minutes, then give up and switch to a database in the current user's home directory." = "IsiX DICOM Viewer está configurado para usar la base de datos en %@. Este volumen no está disponible (aún no montado, desconectado o sin permiso de escritura). IsiX DICOM Viewer esperará unos minutos y pasará a una base de datos en la carpeta de inicio del usuario.";
